{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":209247,\"title\":\"The Art of the Steal\",\"tagline\":\"It takes a great artist to pull off the perfect con.\",\"overview\":\"Crunch Calhoun, a third-rate motorcycle daredevil and part-time art thief, teams up with his snaky brother to steal one of the most valuable books in the world. But it's not just about the book for Crunch — he's keen to rewrite some chapters of his own past as well.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4R6ojBfyO8fj3WszLE9rog5qR4W.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vzAOHT5z3J6xL5UebQPEnjqLpxD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":639,\"year\":2013,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":64065,\"director\":\"Jonathan Sobol\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1041418,\"name\":\"Jonathan Sobol\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5YlLH3iiR8HQxoR21ySMBJ2uxl9.jpg\"},{\"id\":6856,\"name\":\"Kurt Russell\",\"character\":\"Crunch Calhoun\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6g1d98oH4miG4k0ZiZWmF3Dt0bO.jpg\"},{\"id\":2876,\"name\":\"Matt Dillon\",\"character\":\"Nicky Calhoun\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wVoSUexYH79igPgxIXKWRlV2uBk.jpg\"},{\"id\":449,\"name\":\"Jay Baruchel\",\"character\":\"Francie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1GYJeQzPcY9Pfmc3FFsBwClkCv7.jpg\"},{\"id\":6074,\"name\":\"Kenneth Welsh\",\"character\":\"'Uncle' Paddy MacCarthy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hsmY2HaIdOEoTBtwFPxQLyLymYw.jpg\"},{\"id\":1217648,\"name\":\"Chris Diamantopoulos\",\"character\":\"Guy de Cornet\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oenBtpk0RTId4wacQKYU4cPcq8Z.jpg\"},{\"id\":26723,\"name\":\"Katheryn Winnick\",\"character\":\"Lola\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vQSqH3ybDWZHZIqX4NZKhOCXAhQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":185805,\"name\":\"Jason Jones\",\"character\":\"Interpol Agent Bick\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtaO6isGrFtKGbDJNgsujrS1HLK.jpg\"},{\"id\":28641,\"name\":\"Terence Stamp\",\"character\":\"Samuel Winter\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ept9urkuhPbGndVXkERw39R9oid.jpg\"},{\"id\":90498,\"name\":\"Devon Bostick\",\"character\":\"Ponch\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fO1LaBwXX0AIy5JOCdvA1DAJfnK.jpg\"},{\"id\":104151,\"name\":\"Karyn Dwyer\",\"character\":\"Ginger\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fuqGg7SVQ1DGSm3j9Tfk7vmixbJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":86237,\"name\":\"Joe Pingue\",\"character\":\"Carmen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9z9eaG900YmEaW11oHRMENbJhqa.jpg\"},{\"id\":230,\"name\":\"Stephen McHattie\",\"character\":\"Dirty Ernie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zqOwiEDXYM9AKQgHGJGeIp7QkPh.jpg\"},{\"id\":28871,\"name\":\"Eugene Lipinski\",\"character\":\"Bartkowiak\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fIeSERi9a92qvdXWqEMEPyOwBKT.jpg\"},{\"id\":166457,\"name\":\"Elle Downs\",\"character\":\"Female Border Guard\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y3fqH7wsWqEcJS8oPIhDGSfu0eg.jpg\"},{\"id\":108896,\"name\":\"Dax Ravina\",\"character\":\"Sunny\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qncQiqTzATniv2ADs6w5kr36Hb2.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":891621,\"title\":\"Wild Horse Nine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dNJFRtVg3xLQ7dbNIQ55cmmIniD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3uLA0ujne91bkzFStZICCYeqhnt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shortly before the 1973 Chilean coup, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Island by their bureau chief, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues, and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1054867,\"title\":\"One Battle After Another\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lbBWwxBht4JFP5PsuJ5onpMqugW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hiazLNa1UXuX35OTnMQRKOx3eTk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Washed-up revolutionary Bob exists in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited, self-reliant daughter, Willa. When his evil nemesis resurfaces after 16 years and she goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her, father and daughter both battling the consequences of his past.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":106646,\"title\":\"The Wolf of Wall Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kW9LmvYHAaS9iA0tHmZVq8hQYoq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Nwnmyzrtd0FkcRyPqmdzTPppQa.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A New York stockbroker refuses to cooperate in a large securities fraud case involving corruption on Wall Street, corporate banking world and mob infiltration. Based on Jordan Belfort's autobiography.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14034,\"title\":\"What's the Worst That Could Happen?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dF9vz1LB6078ULfweT2vxdWZzos.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tONZXxOfDjYYSeVaGSmLpHpqO5B.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Thief Kevin Caffery attempts to rob from the home of rich businessman Max Fairbanks. But Fairbanks catches him and steals his cherished ring that his girlfriend gave him. Caffery is then bent on revenge and getting his ring back with the help of his partners.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1168190,\"title\":\"The Wrecking Crew\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gbVwHl4YPSq6BcC92TQpe7qUTh6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cz4vLJrmaV1zJlRYbxqtvLzeLWB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Estranged half-brothers Jonny and James reunite after their father's mysterious death. As they search for the truth, buried secrets reveal a conspiracy threatening to tear their family apart.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12153,\"title\":\"White Chicks\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aHTUpo45qy9QYIOnVITGGqLoVcA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/di47xqYMCYpjqwnqNlO17X5qXMX.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two FBI agent brothers, Marcus and Kevin Copeland, accidentally foil a drug bust. To avoid being fired they accept a mission escorting a pair of socialites to the Hamptons--but when the girls are disfigured in a car accident, they refuse to go. Left without options, Marcus and Kevin decide to pose as the sisters, transforming themselves from black men into rich white women.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20352,\"title\":\"Despicable Me\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b1BT309QWjtFUlJPLmXmrcHOWEL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2XSeKDmIa2KxaiJy4J9e8FrIZhk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Determined to prove he's the world's greatest supervillain, Gru hatches an audacious plan to steal the Moon. To pull it off, he adopts three orphaned girls—Margo, Edith, and Agnes—intending to use them as pawns in his scheme. But the unexpected bond they form forces him to question the criminal life he's always known.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":546554,\"title\":\"Knives Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pThyQovXQrw2m0s9x82twj48Jq4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4HWAQu28e2yaWrtupFPGFkdNU7V.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When renowned crime novelist Harlan Thrombey is found dead at his estate just after his 85th birthday, the inquisitive and debonair Detective Benoit Blanc is mysteriously enlisted to investigate. From Harlan's dysfunctional family to his devoted staff, Blanc sifts through a web of red herrings and self-serving lies to uncover the truth behind Harlan's untimely death.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1301421,\"title\":\"The Sheep Detectives\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKy5460GdsoknM8ppmGlJbKxAKa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g6uEVedSBXsZ3QuXKP4WDCeSsOy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"George Hardy is a shepherd who reads detective novels to his beloved sheep every night, assuming they can't possibly understand. But when a mysterious incident disrupts life on the farm, the sheep realize they must become the detectives. As they follow the clues and investigate human suspects, they prove that even sheep can be brilliant crime-solvers.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9470,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Hustle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/exbyTbrvRUDKN2mcNEuVor4VFQW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4JKluvwcYvhkTNvWP5N3kcUNsPl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's the 1940s, and the notorious Axe Gang terrorizes Shanghai. Small-time criminals Sing and Bone hope to join, but they only manage to make lots of very dangerous enemies. Fortunately for them, kung fu masters and hidden strength can be found in unlikely places. Now they just have to take on the entire Axe Gang.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":207703,\"title\":\"Kingsman: The Secret Service\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r6q9wZK5a2K51KFj4LWVID6Ja1r.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qzUIOTk0E3F1zjvYjcBRTKUTgf9.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of a super-secret spy organization that recruits an unrefined but promising street kid into the agency's ultra-competitive training program just as a global threat emerges from a twisted tech genius.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Comedy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":438148,\"title\":\"Minions: The Rise of Gru\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4dBDk1LPdvdhcZdjQBmdXwiVKUA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wZS4xSfPtk1NPQnx9zsT5R2WhCu.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fanboy of a supervillain supergroup known as the Vicious 6, Gru hatches a plan to become evil enough to join them, with the backup of his followers, the Minions.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"qe0OU2ZibFI\",\"name\":\"Official International Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"mGh_w93E4Ho\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}